{# The création, as a component: the stepper, the three step panels and the document property
   panel, with no page chrome of any kind.

   It takes everything it draws from its parameters and posts to named routes, so it mounts
   unchanged in a page (templates/dossier/wizard.html.twig), in a modal or in a side panel from any
   other entry point of the platform - which is what the handoff asks of it. The breadcrumb, the h1
   and the « Précédent / Suivant » pair are the page's, not this file's: they are the parts that
   only make sense full screen.

   Parameters (passed with `only`): dossier, step, groups, selection, isNewDocument,
   candidatePrograms, candidateStudents, programLabels, cibleCount, depositTypes,
   validationProfiles. #}
<div class="cm-dd-card">
    {% include 'dossier/wizard/_stepper.html.twig' with {dossier: dossier, step: step} only %}

    {% if 1 == step %}
        {% include 'dossier/wizard/_step_settings.html.twig' with {
            dossier: dossier, candidatePrograms: candidatePrograms, candidateStudents: candidateStudents,
        } only %}
    {% elseif 2 == step %}
        {% include 'dossier/wizard/_step_documents.html.twig' with {
            dossier: dossier, groups: groups, selection: selection, isNewDocument: isNewDocument,
            depositTypes: depositTypes, validationProfiles: validationProfiles,
        } only %}
    {% else %}
        {% include 'dossier/wizard/_step_summary.html.twig' with {
            dossier: dossier, programLabels: programLabels, cibleCount: cibleCount,
        } only %}
    {% endif %}
</div>
